00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:23.740
Mr. Ract!

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:48.180
This is Mukured Madorna.

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:51.100
My Shaldoll forces will assist the Diva!{lucky ract}

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:54.810
Sorry.

